# SHA-256 of every source tarball the build scripts download: "<sha256>  <url>",
# and the commit of every git tag they clone: "<commit>  <url>#<tag>". The
# web build also checks files of the emsdk release it compiles with:
# "<sha256>  emsdk:<version>/upstream/<file>", and for the native tools
# (clang, wasm-ld, wasm-opt, wasm-emscripten-finalize, llvm-ar), pinned per
# host, "<sha256>  emsdk:<version>/<os>-<arch>/upstream/bin/<tool>".
# Checked by verify_source and verify_git_source in _helpers.sh. Add the line
# a local build prints for an unpinned source (or run with RECORD_SOURCES=<file>).
